GAL16V8
Counter4

Clock EN   NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   GND
/OE   NC   NC   NC   Q3   Q2   Q1   Q0   NC   VCC

Q0.R = EN * /Q0 + /EN * Q0
Q1.R = /EN * Q1 + Q1 * /Q0 + EN * /Q1 * Q0
Q2.R = /EN * Q2 + Q2 * /Q0 + Q2 * /Q1 + EN * /Q2 * Q0 * Q1
Q3.R = /EN * Q3 + Q3 * /Q0 + Q3 * /Q1 + Q3 * /Q2 + EN * /Q3 * Q0 * Q1 * Q2

DESCRIPTION

Bench test for MiniGecko (MINIGECKO-011): a 4-bit binary up-counter on
pins 15-18 (Q0 = pin 18, Q3 = pin 15), counting on each rising clock edge on pin 1
while EN (pin 2) is high. Pin 11 (/OE) must be low for the outputs to drive.
Uses the GAL's registered mode, where the gates design uses its
combinational mode.
